{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["עבית — from the root of במעבה האדמה. Like מן מראה ראית, מעשה עשית (and likewise the yod stands in place of heh in its root)." "אלוה עשהו — He is the one who made you and established you." "וינבל — A foolish nation and not a wise one. גוי נבל ולא חכם."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "Rashbam reads the unusual form עבית as exhibiting a yod where a heh would be expected in the root עבה, comparable to the morphological pattern of forms like ראית and עשית."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:39:47.852120949Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}